type: software
title: "org.Osativa.eg.db: Genome-wide annotation for Oryza sativa (MSU and RAP-DB)"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-11-01"
license: Artistic-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/SiYangming/org.Osativa.eg.db"
url: "https://github.com/SiYangming/org.Osativa.eg.db"
authors:
  - family-names: siyangming
    email: yangming-6863@qq.com
  - family-names: xuzhougeng
    email: xuzhougeng@163.com
abstract: >-
  Organism annotation package for Oryza sativa Japonica Group. The central
  gene ID (GID) is the MSU/RGAP LOC_Os identifier. RAP-DB locus IDs are
  available as keytype RAP. Gene Ontology terms come from the RAP-DB
  2026-02-05 representative annotation mapped onto MSU IDs.
keywords:
  - Oryza sativa
  - rice
  - OrgDb
  - AnnotationDbi
  - RAP-DB
  - MSU
  - Gene Ontology
